# Excerpts of the Mac runs behind docs/vulkan-path.md (2026-10-08, Apple M5 Pro, MoltenVK 1.4.2,
# Homebrew vulkan-loader 1.4.363). Commands are in docs/vulkan-path.md, "Running it on the Mac".
# Depth on the GPU paths comes from the picking layer's depth target on the GPU (patched
# re_renderer); the CPU path reads the same depth back.

